{"kind":"html","caption":"固定长度为 |p| = 3 的滑动窗口从左向右扫描 s，并维护窗口内字符频次。窗口每移动一步，只需移出左端字符、加入右端字符；当窗口频次与 p 的频次完全一致时，记录窗口起点。示例中窗口 \"cba\" 和 \"bac\" 匹配，因此得到索引 [0, 6]。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>找到字符串中所有字母异位词</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{height:auto;margin:0}body{background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:14px}.app{width:100%;min-height:auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:clamp(16px,4vw,40px)}.panel{width:min(100%,980px);background:#252526;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:12px;padding:clamp(16px,3vw,30px);box-shadow:0 12px 34px rgba(0,0,0,.25)}h1{font-size:clamp(18px,3vw,25px);margin:0 0 8px;color:#fff}.lead{margin:0 0 24px;color:#aaa}.mono,.char,.index,.count,.result{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}.inputs{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-bottom:24px}.pill{padding:8px 12px;background:#333;border-radius:6px}.accent{color:#3794ff}.track-wrap{overflow-x:auto;padding:8px 2px 18px}.track{position:relative;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(10,minmax(38px,1fr));gap:6px;min-width:500px;padding-top:30px}.char{position:relative;height:52px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border:1px solid #555;border-radius:7px;background:#2d2d2d;font-size:20px;transition:.35s ease}.char.active{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff;transform:translateY(-3px)}.char.match{box-shadow:0 0 0 2px #3794ff inset,0 0 15px rgba(55,148,255,.3)}.index{position:absolute;top:-22px;color:#858585;font-size:12px}.window-label{height:26px;margin:4px 0 14px;color:#3794ff;font-weight:600}.content{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(240px,1fr) minmax(240px,1fr);gap:16px}.card{background:#2d2d2d;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:8px;padding:15px}.card-title{color:#fff;margin-bottom:12px;font-weight:600}.counts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:8px}.count{padding:10px 6px;text-align:center;background:#252526;border-radius:5px;transition:.3s}.count.ok{color:#fff;background:#0e639c}.status{min-height:48px;line-height:1.6}.status strong{color:#3794ff}.result-line{margin-top:15px;border-top:1px solid #444;padding-top:13px}.result{color:#3794ff;font-size:17px}.note{margin-top:18px;color:#aaa;line-height:1.65}.note b{color:#d4d4d4}@media(max-width:650px){.content{grid-template-columns:1fr}.track{min-width:480px}.panel{border-radius:8px}}\n/* COMPACT */ html,body{font-size:12px!important;line-height:1.45!important}.app{padding:8px 10px 10px!important;display:block!important;min-height:auto!important}.panel{max-width:560px!important;margin:0 auto!important;padding:8px 10px!important;border-radius:6px!important;box-shadow:none!important}h1{font-size:14px!important;margin:0 0 4px!important;color:#d4d4d4!important}.lead{font-size:12px!important;color:#8d8d8d!important;margin:0 0 8px!important}.inputs{gap:6px!important;margin-bottom:8px!important}.pill{padding:2px 7px!important;border-radius:4px!important;font-size:11px!important}.track{grid-template-columns:repeat(10,38px)!important;gap:4px!important;min-width:0!important;padding-top:22px!important}.char{width:38px!important;height:48px!important;padding:4px 2px!important;border-radius:4px!important;border-width:1px!important;font-size:14px!important}.index{font-size:10px!important;top:-16px!important;color:#8d8d8d!important}.window-label{font-size:11px!important;margin:4px 0 8px!important}.content{display:grid!important;grid-template-columns:1fr!important;gap:8px!important}.card{padding:8px 10px!important;border-radius:6px!important}.count{padding:6px 4px!important;font-size:11px!important;border-radius:4px!important}.status{min-height:auto!important;font-size:12px!important}.result{font-size:13px!important}.note{font-size:11px!important;margin-top:8px!important;color:#8d8d8d!important}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"app\"><section class=\"panel\">\n<h1>固定窗口扫描</h1>\n<p class=\"lead\">窗口长度始终等于 <span class=\"mono accent\">p.length</span>，比较字符频次而非排列顺序。</p>\n<div class=\"inputs\"><div class=\"pill mono\">s = \"cbaebabacd\"</div><div class=\"pill mono\">p = \"abc\"</div><div class=\"pill\">窗口长度 = <span class=\"mono accent\">3</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"track-wrap\"><div id=\"track\" class=\"track\"></div></div>\n<div id=\"windowLabel\" class=\"window-label\"></div>\n<div class=\"content\">\n<div class=\"card\"><div class=\"card-title\">频次对照</div><div class=\"counts\"><div id=\"ca\" class=\"count\"></div><div id=\"cb\" class=\"count\"></div><div id=\"cc\" class=\"count\"></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"card\"><div class=\"card-title\">当前判断</div><div id=\"status\" class=\"status\"></div><div class=\"result-line\">已记录：<span id=\"result\" class=\"result\">[]</span></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"note\"><b>复杂度：</b>每个字符至多进入和离开窗口一次，时间复杂度 <span class=\"mono\">O(|s|)</span>；小写字母频次数组固定为 26 项，额外空间 <span class=\"mono\">O(1)</span>。</div>\n</section></main>\n<script>\nconst s='cbaebabacd', p='abc', width=p.length;\nconst target={a:1,b:1,c:1};\nconst track=document.getElementById('track');\n[...s].forEach((ch,i)=>{const el=document.createElement('div');el.className='char';el.innerHTML='<span class=\"index\">'+i+'</span>'+ch;track.appendChild(el)});\nconst cells=[...document.querySelectorAll('.char')];\nconst countEls={a:document.getElementById('ca'),b:document.getElementById('cb'),c:document.getElementById('cc')};\nlet start=0, results=[];\nfunction render(){\n const sub=s.slice(start,start+width), freq={a:0,b:0,c:0};\n [...sub].forEach(ch=>{if(ch in freq)freq[ch]++});\n const match=Object.keys(target).every(ch=>freq[ch]===target[ch]);\n cells.forEach((el,i)=>{el.className='char'+(i>=start&&i<start+width?' active':'')+(match&&i>=start&&i<start+width?' match':'')});\n Object.keys(countEls).forEach(ch=>{const ok=freq[ch]===target[ch];countEls[ch].className='count'+(ok?' ok':'');countEls[ch].textContent=ch+': '+freq[ch]+' / '+target[ch]});\n document.getElementById('windowLabel').textContent='窗口 ['+start+', '+(start+width-1)+'] = \"'+sub+'\"';\n if(match&&!results.includes(start))results.push(start);\n document.getElementById('status').innerHTML=match?'频次完全相同，<strong>记录起点 '+start+'</strong>。':'频次不同，窗口继续右移。';\n document.getElementById('result').textContent='['+results.join(', ')+']';\n}\nfunction advance(){start++;if(start>s.length-width){start=0;results=[]}render()}\nrender();setInterval(advance,1300);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","svg":"","media":""}
